      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "AMIENS.\nI would not change it. Happy is your grace,\nThat can translate the stubbornness of fortune\nInto so quiet and so sweet a style.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
