      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "DUKE SENIOR.\nCome, shall we go and kill us venison?\nAnd yet it irks me the poor dappled fools,\nBeing native burghers of this desert city,\nShould in their own confines with forked heads\nHave their round haunches gored.",
